[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10983.67, "timestamp": "03:03:03", "text": "你的表格。你把短弓拖到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10987.03, "timestamp": "03:03:07", "text": "你的第二个……嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10988.79, "timestamp": "03:03:08", "text": "对，就是这样。所以现在如果你想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10990.389, "timestamp": "03:03:10", "text": "要切换它，请点击圆圈。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10993.99, "timestamp": "03:03:13", "text": "中间。所以它会改变你的手"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10997.03, "timestamp": "03:03:17", "text": "迈步并举盾，向短弓方向移动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10999.99, "timestamp": "03:03:19", "text": "我可以在这里再放一个盾牌吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11003.99, "timestamp": "03:03:23", "text": "呃，你不能用弓箭同时举盾牌。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11004.309, "timestamp": "03:03:24", "text": "毫米。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11006.07, "timestamp": "03:03:26", "text": "哦，我不能。哦，是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11009.269, "timestamp": "03:03:29", "text": "是啊，因为弓是双手武器。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11009.91, "timestamp": "03:03:29", "text": "哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11011.91, "timestamp": "03:03:31", "text": "我们为什么需要这么多盾牌？坚持，稍等。患病的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11013.03, "timestamp": "03:03:33", "text": "解决这个问题。不用担心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11014.469, "timestamp": "03:03:34", "text": "哦，我把它拖了出来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11016.87, "timestamp": "03:03:36", "text": "如果将内容拖入，它会被复制。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11019.99, "timestamp": "03:03:39", "text": "它。让我快速把它删掉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11024.07, "timestamp": "03:03:44", "text": "好的。好的。但是，是的，也是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11025.75, "timestamp": "03:03:45", "text": "请记住，当你拿着……时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11027.59, "timestamp": "03:03:47", "text": "短弓，短弓不是一种法术。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11029.99, "timestamp": "03:03:49", "text": "施法专注，所以你不能施法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11031.349, "timestamp": "03:03:51", "text": "需要材料的法术"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11034.15, "timestamp": "03:03:54", "text": "成分。记住这一点。但是它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11035.67, "timestamp": "03:03:55", "text": "不会吧，其实没那么重要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11037.59, "timestamp": "03:03:57", "text": "除非你是在随意尝试。"}]